+/*
+  streamingbox extension: statistics file (-S <file>)
+
+  Once per second a snapshot is written (atomically) to the file: the state of the bitrate controller, the SRT
+  statistics, how many frames per second pass the main points of the pipeline (decoders, the inputs of the
+  compositor, its output, the encoder) and the GStreamer warnings / errors counted per category.
+  It is for diagnosis only: the support log of streamingbox reads it, nothing in here changes how belacoder works.
+*/
